.Sh CAVEATS
With
.Fl "-reverse" ,
the input is evaluated as Janet source in order to produce the
data structure that is converted.
Any code in the input is therefore run.
Do not pass input from an untrusted source to
.Nm
with
.Fl "-reverse" .
.
